    "result": {
      "ok": true,
      "stdout": "Reverse-sync a real draft back into blueprint XML.\r\nWhen --workspace is provided, target_draft.xml,\r\ncurrent_draft.xml, and id_map.json are updated.\r\nWithout --workspace, XML is returned in the output envelope\r\nand no files are written.\r\n\r\nAGENT QUICKSTART (driving this as an agent? start here):\r\n  Browse commands:  lyra-cli <domain> --help\r\n\r\nUSAGE:\r\n  lyra-cli <domain> <[subdomain] ...> <action> [--flags] [--options]\r\n\r\n\r\nOPTIONS:\r\n  -h,     --help              Print this help message and exit\r\n          --workspace TEXT:DIR \r\n                              Blueprint workspace directory. Optional; when omitted the\r\n                              generated XML is returned without writing files.\r\n          --ref TEXT REQUIRED Source draft reference, e.g. local://my_draft.\r\n          --current-only      Refresh current_draft.xml, id_map.json, and resource_map.json\r\n                              while preserving target_draft.xml. Requires --workspace.\r\n  -v,     --version           Show version information and exit.\r\n          --jq TEXT           Pretty-print JSON output; with an optional selector like\r\n                              .result.items[0].id, output the selected JSON value instead of\r\n                              the full schema envelope.\r\n\r\nEXAMPLES\r\n  $ lyra-cli draft blueprint sync --workspace ./bp_ws --ref local://example\r\n  $ lyra-cli draft blueprint sync --ref local://example\r\n\r\nLEARN MORE\r\n  Use this command to convert an existing draft back into blueprint XML.\r\n  Omit `--workspace` when the XML should be returned without writing files.\r\n",
      "stderr": "",
      "output": "Reverse-sync a real draft back into blueprint XML.\r\nWhen --workspace is provided, target_draft.xml,\r\ncurrent_draft.xml, and id_map.json are updated.\r\nWithout --workspace, XML is returned in the output envelope\r\nand no files are written.\r\n\r\nAGENT QUICKSTART (driving this as an agent? start here):\r\n  Browse commands:  lyra-cli <domain> --help\r\n\r\nUSAGE:\r\n  lyra-cli <domain> <[subdomain] ...> <action> [--flags] [--options]\r\n\r\n\r\nOPTIONS:\r\n  -h,     --help              Print this help message and exit\r\n          --workspace TEXT:DIR \r\n                              Blueprint workspace directory. Optional; when omitted the\r\n                              generated XML is returned without writing files.\r\n          --ref TEXT REQUIRED Source draft reference, e.g. local://my_draft.\r\n          --current-only      Refresh current_draft.xml, id_map.json, and resource_map.json\r\n                              while preserving target_draft.xml. Requires --workspace.\r\n  -v,     --version           Show version information and exit.\r\n          --jq TEXT           Pretty-print JSON output; with an optional selector like\r\n                              .result.items[0].id, output the selected JSON value instead of\r\n                              the full schema envelope.\r\n\r\nEXAMPLES\r\n  $ lyra-cli draft blueprint sync --workspace ./bp_ws --ref local://example\r\n  $ lyra-cli draft blueprint sync --ref local://example\r\n\r\nLEARN MORE\r\n  Use this command to convert an existing draft back into blueprint XML.\r\n  Omit `--workspace` when the XML should be returned without writing files.\r\n",
